    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52e44f4dbe0ccecf00504df1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・染上蓝色",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0e372d243a9b347b31790b46b8c6b20ee7e9f6dd6272a37c27ff16ee718c9ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa5d1309dae2abc1cac14639",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "态度温和、待人亲切，\n但却蕴含着坚强意志，大和抚子般的草上飞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15d21cd1c9d1d0227a88050ab0a53042586487f223bf6aa8561e909acca5a61e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:706c1e2137ef1a89d46ccb94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她将“坚定不移”四字铭记在心，\n以闪耀系列赛的“顶点”为目标，\n展开挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4c06d98e591a5a3ed6f8818539f0ddefd3cbbf2177165f12f94d17e6c45ffbf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce54a220f3fee545f2cad370",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "草上飞登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f68bb85b4909a4cea65d044fe7917050837d29f0fb3afc3dd9c68087def2be6f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37d0ea392ce203208ac1b3a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即将迎向“出道战”的草上飞\n在模拟赛中展现了\n压倒性的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4c4ea5e55de748b97bf716be3c74c9e2248fabf5275ffb20eb19158fafc119f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1208530c2e908c5297c0f90",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的表现令人联想到\n被称为“怪物”的丸善斯基，\n因此在记者群中成了一大话题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee822b595dc9c8d11c14f0d65e6d5491b20ab774829691d0e2b84b860b0c3797",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9e22a001ce288b177716ec9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "知道自己被拿来与丸善斯基比较后，\n她转换了想法，决定要超越“怪物”，\n站上“顶点”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ebec7ffba366805f080ff9431011cebdee1a67e0ea38aaf2b10e01e8ea0b367",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ba65f94d18df5756613b234",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“怪物二世”",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7b526ad8bf5e225b9fe47f6329a67bd2f83f179497eaf8823b2b2d5ddfadf28",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb61fd543084c0384b66fbf8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“日本德比”近在眼前的某一天。\n预计参赛的赛马娘齐聚一堂，\n发表各自的想法与抱负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57b5b74d37f960cbf6fc02d6d44b98bc36c7ccba28d361648cb8e401979538ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b303eb08bca79678b0d1377b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这种场合，\n相较于其他赛马娘，\n就只有草上飞的发言既沉着又没有敌意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48b61d0ca76239a00c73d56334552a1196838ad6f73e179c5c1634b201f356d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe94957dfd110a09e558bf6d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "几天后，\n神鹰前来找草上飞，\n对没有在记者会上表露真心的她下了战帖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2db9eb3acddfe5a025be9b2656947d66841b0baf4c0f2a5e8884db385c094a47",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16d0631186a350e26825f489",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "草上飞默默地燃起了\n在“日本德比”\n拿下优胜的斗志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd510b29b2590a362e8cbb1219d1fcd284e79547311ac2f5ce21d7cb601ed7eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f28e9fc4e8bce3e4042ee6c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "集结而来的都是一代豪杰",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2a10f46dd105ac4a7cb503c99d5873f987472bfbda322046783a024ccd2b9dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13113f0ee57e6cc04044b355",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "粉丝票选的结果，\n草上飞以亮眼的票数获得\n“有马纪念”参赛权。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ebc0b0832211d631a0990b0289e1458a7b585c66eb0add6dc2140cbb2bfdffd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc95aabcfdb0d9d62b3af3c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与丸善斯基正面交锋的时刻\n终于逼近眼前，\n草上飞已经无法压抑心中的激动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48cff726743410af076b866781b0d5dbb928c7710f7e3ee409abc1966286eb00",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b72331183ad8349efefd9c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，丸善斯基因为在训练时受伤，\n而打消了参加\n“有马纪念”的念头。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52fc6e205631100d362782f0090a0dae85aceda294c9154bf6d55a30cb880d70",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:490f3140ae24f6697caf0960",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此外，草上飞还得知了\n丸善斯基在“有马纪念”结束后，\n将退出闪耀系列赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e618154b430c110847ef027426610c206a3c1d908f48eb1671296c19c2f55bd8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35704de1a1e9a1e791b9e011",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无法触及之人",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cb2fee20529ba8a5bc2e957d681b69ba1ea8269436dc6623bb7300aafe61852",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d99c2440fd09c8d9c4af6dd6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即将迎向“有马纪念”的某一天。\n草上飞收到特别周的信息，\n因此前往顶楼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fa4a25e56e2a0151e9a99f86fbae91ffd9e7d9ff790c32b41474de37239e688",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78a6cc2deb9711b892a034a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "草上飞到了顶楼后，\n特别周向她宣告\n自己将会赢得有马纪念的优胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad2113049fb9b7e21d223d2b836885eff8d4046c61174052e702c9df4fd1c943",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6e43c3daf2bd7889cec4ab8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接下战帖的草上飞\n沉稳地回复道：“我会全力以赴。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "b80037cfab7f52c677302c2133f4e5aa040df0510646f90c614cd37000ea02ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e312350e5d48e183d6302da9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她与许多劲敌一同成长至今。\n现在，她尝试再次实现\n惊人的蜕变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ffd4e75b69d1c584195962e8737fde43eb58cd87f1fab7268f85f4cc624e0e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:851696a1a59f779575de4a27",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "宿敌，觉醒",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c180e8075d03d2cf84d2fa63bbe52b5709292c004c19a8e023cb791e731e564",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07bb21625e4310043d2a19bb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏天……\n提升实力的绝佳机会到来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbae6f282e88c1e6e2bb6367f6ecff529c0e8218ab7689c1ef6884ed4931c01c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86cf9ad861d5a027a565b14f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "将“日本杯”视为目标的草上飞乍看悠哉，\n实际上她的心里燃烧着\n旺盛的斗志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e728c7215b6d0988b3b636b62248059a66255af992d016d2f5d4e0456fb2696f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d110dbf906c9377dfcc649cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了隐藏内心而故作镇静的她与我的\n热血夏季集训开始了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd86c2c818d950e70894e0047bf8da55183c15d88dca81af48b8f17cbba2cca4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10c645ffc2cc4cfc5b33223e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第二年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e193ad94ba56712a8e92ed87a15587d1a6af48670f61e354efcb818a0837f0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6132826790397c19eb7f475",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训的时期再度来临。\n草上飞在集训宿舍碰见丸善斯基后，\n与她交谈了一会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "508d8633da4127c0060213fad7a7dbb4270a85881e77629050a08b1a1e7a3100",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b5efede6f9e3c824652c6b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "丸善斯基说完话后，转身离去。\n对草上飞而言，\n她的背影看起来十分庞大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25c11eb12f951b4fb35e5cf4d30f6c1e584bdec2841995bb778e3c48870e96b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63effa718e2c76fe14faca98",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，从去年到现在，\n草上飞也成长了许多。\n我将与蜕变的她一起展开夏季集训！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a1b7345fb537c2d6d9fef53f7e085ded63e150c4d9d01dc265fba5c022dfbdb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf9f6d53e61e97c63f0d7ecc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第三年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef37080660583492caac78b957b8f144bbb2896156162385fc6034f5649e4df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f28b681d618ae1296a13626",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终于到了草上飞的\n“出道战”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3ff76d139f8f28af1f6dbd2c65c30fe56dccda5d7eed2d4e2164aa5a46399bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd5bba388ad0c093be86280a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "草上飞与紧张不已的训练员完全相反，\n自始至终都很冷静。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c974dedf832b45a4d495fbed6224509de734cfb5bf7a392aac121c19bb0bdd0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3059a137a3aa99a033580a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "草上飞表示她不会焦急，会展现平常的自己。\n语毕，她便走向了赛道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e86efeaee7591b68d683552a17793e36abd7b546e06de1a6759be7528785b678",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61942ca6eb67684c0fb2cdfe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea754365577b70c3247fb413fa7b90388e1e4a185a1da5f6c50ef25fe13c496",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:160d91226e238384c94eda01",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看台坐满观众，\n名为GⅠ竞赛的重要舞台……\n“朝日杯FS”当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee0ee58100f1b9a0587eafce8076d4be0df1c4774d1e25b6bae1aeae996a044b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a988495e312f205bbaaba6d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了向众人证明自己不是丸善斯基“二世”，\n也不是“接班人”，\n而是拥有站上“顶点”才能之人──",
      "source_fingerprint": "5828a9bc3d4799ca0f3fe8274bdc4ca5b0e770a09aa75b7763246d85a8329a68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ed4a2c382677c0d38f62a4f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她迈开步伐，走向赛道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b55512d8a85d8dac01c89fddf56422777977fb10e9bd3a0f554593eed67b5da5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90a59ecd5b7c3769353b3071",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向朝日杯FS",
      "source_fingerprint": "c58d0a8ed9da5f98ec7710e3088881050acc605b7600f6ec929511efc05e1d7c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3cd698f72da0751d0562d6d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "草上飞与神鹰约好认真一决胜负的舞台──\n“日本德比”比赛当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35b67d5275cb656e29bc65aadcf6ebba400e520fcd1e80634550d14dae675fe4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
