      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛开始的前一刻，面对神鹰的草上飞\n将身为“怪物二世”的骄傲深埋心底，\n与她一同迈向决战之地。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b30ceb9fd633509502eb1293cc0140cc3d81d913e113c0e0a756ef7636c92e39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
